<title>USA: Hughes' DirecTV subsriber base hits 2 mln.</title>
<headline>Hughes' DirecTV subsriber base hits 2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>DirecTV, Inc, the unit of Hughes Electronics Inc offering satellite-based television service, said it has started service for its two millionth subscriber, doubling the client base in just 11 months.</p>
<p>DirecTV now is viewed in one of every 50 homes that have television sets in the United States, and customer satisfaction approaches 95 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a benchmark achievement and we are extremely gratified,&quot; Eddy Hartenstein, president, said.</p>
<p>DirecTV delivers over 175 channels of television along with pay-per-view movies and sports packages.</p>
</text>
